        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2002/18, 18\" Contemporary Nobe Bathroom Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana BBN2002/18 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. At 18\", it is large enough to hang multiple towels at once. It is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. This Nobe series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2002_18-specifications.gif?v=1704354777\" width=\"596\" height=\"185\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2002/18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-12-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2003-12\"><b>12\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-24-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2003-24\"><b>24\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-30-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2004-30\"><b>30\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the BBN Nobe Solid Brass 18 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2002_18.pdf?v=1691095367\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2002/18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
